# Owner scope and authoring direction

The owner requested the **Advanced QFT and supersymmetry** category and then
directed: **“Start building as soon as it's ready.”** This authorizes the native
physics build in this isolated checkout. The dated scaffold remains a research
design; its earlier scaffold-only dispatch language does not revoke this later
build authorization. Every ordinary native prerequisite, source, review, repair,
gate and owner hold remains binding. Do not publish or push. New content remains
draft.

The approved starting scope is the 55 A/B pairs in this run's native manifests
and scope ledger: 36 physics pairs in `advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry` and 19
purely mathematical support pairs in `quantum-field-theory-mathematics`.
Read `research/plan-advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry-track.md`, the complete
`research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/scaffold/prose-scaffold.md`, the
