The smallest substantive *consumer* work remains the already assigned finite operator quotient construction with a stable relation subspace and its fixed-order variational/observable proof. These are existing authoring obligations, not proved by this review, not new open problems, and not grounds to claim readiness or omit substantial approved EFT scope. If authoring later exposes an actual additional prerequisite, record its exact interface and consumers before adding a genuinely needed support pair. Root alone owns receipt integration, current-input hashes, the hold decision and native gates.
