+---
+id: ex-aqft-operator-basis-reduction
+kind: example
+title: A dimension-six scalar operator reduced by integration by parts and the leading equation
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 4
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
