+---
+id: lem-aqft-finite-order-local-operator-space-finite-dimensional
+kind: lemma
+title: Finite dimensionality of fixed-order local operator spaces
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 1
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
