+One stale scaffold mismatch is recorded: the `qftx-eft-operator-quotients` object in `research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/scaffold/proposed-inventory.json` lists only `aqft-susy-math-foundations` under `requires`, while both the complete design and active plan also require `reductive-affine-invariant-theory-and-geometric-quotients`. The plan controls. The active manifest keeps both page requirements; no global plan or imported page is edited.
