+
+[Burgess, §§2.1–2.2](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/0701053)
+
+[Neubert, §2](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-ph/0512222)
+
+[Criado–Pérez-Victoria, §§3 and 5.1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1811.09413)
