+---
+id: lem-aqft-invariant-quotient-exactness
+kind: lemma
+title: Exactness of invariant vectors for a finite-dimensional quotient
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
