+
+Scoped checks passed: strict proof contracts, 8/8 items; proof layout, 8 items and 22 numbered steps; normative precheck, 5 proof-bearing items; source fetch, 4/4 sources current with zero drops; source coverage, 10 harvested dispositions; `content-policy`, 8 items; focused `depcheck`, 8 assigned items and the selected dependency/cycle closure; item dependency levels, with per-item values in the table and multiset $0,0,1,1,2,3,4,4$; renderer/YAML check, 8 items and 2 pages; statement-first inspection, 8 assigned items; and manifest/body reconciliation, 8 statements and 2 empty-body pages.
