+`page-layout.mjs prepare --run advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23 --domain physics` was attempted after authoring. It stopped before any writes because the run-wide manifest still contains an unassigned empty inventory for `aqft-eft-operators`; the mechanical page-layout tool validates all pages in the run before mutating any. The assigned page bodies are empty and renderer-clean, but the engine-owned `page_layout: compact-v1` flag remains for run-wide preparation once every page inventory is authored. This does not change the eight item readiness decisions or authorize modifying another pair.
